WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.009
Toad stood on the boat.

2
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:22.405
He watched the countryside roll by.

3
00:00:22.406 --> 00:00:27.738
"I'm finally on my way home!" he sighed.

4
00:00:27.739 --> 00:00:31.873
The possum looked at Toad's dress.

5
00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:35.934
"So you're a washwoman?" she asked.

6
00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:42.012
"Oh yes," said Toad, remembering how he looked.

7
00:00:42.013 --> 00:00:45.475
Then he could not stop himself.

8
00:00:45.476 --> 00:00:48.668
He started to brag.

9
00:00:48.669 --> 00:00:52.952
"I have the best business in the country!

10
00:00:52.953 --> 00:00:55.952
The richest people bring me their clothes!

11
00:00:55.953 --> 00:01:00.681
And twenty washwomen work for me," said Toad.

12
00:01:00.682 --> 00:01:04.357
"I'm very impressed!" said the possum.

13
00:01:04.358 --> 00:01:09.551
"I just love doing the wash," said Toad.

14
00:01:09.552 --> 00:01:12.874
"When I'm washing, I feel great!

15
00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:17.150
I clean clothes better than anyone."

16
00:01:17.151 --> 00:01:21.296
"How lucky that I met you!" said the possum.

17
00:01:21.297 --> 00:01:24.547
"What do you mean?" asked Toad.

18
00:01:24.548 --> 00:01:28.237
"My dirty clothes are in the back," she said.

19
00:01:28.238 --> 00:01:30.230
"They need washing."

20
00:01:30.231 --> 00:01:34.882
"Oh, why didn't I keep quiet?" thought Toad.

21
00:01:34.883 --> 00:01:38.701
"There's a tub and some soap too," she said.

22
00:01:38.702 --> 00:01:42.133
"But, but . . . ," said Toad.

23
00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:46.033
"It will take a while to get to Toad Hall," she said.

24
00:01:46.034 --> 00:01:49.550
"You can enjoy yourself on the way!"

25
00:01:49.551 --> 00:01:53.886
"Let me steer for you," said Toad.

26
00:01:53.887 --> 00:01:57.051
"You must be tired of steering.

27
00:01:57.052 --> 00:01:59.878
Then you can do the washing."

28
00:01:59.879 --> 00:02:02.999
"No, no," she said.

29
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.016
"You go have some fun!"

30
00:02:06.017 --> 00:02:10.473
"I don't know how to wash," thought Toad.

31
00:02:10.474 --> 00:02:13.962
"What are you waiting for?" asked the possum.

32
00:02:13.963 --> 00:02:20.089
Then Toad thought, "Oh, I'm sure it's easy.

33
00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:24.182
Anyone can wash clothes!"
